Upstream: https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft/pull/3463
Subject: gridcraft-web: access modes for host pages (view, comment, edit) and "save now"

JD Sheets patch 0001 (Decisions 8, 43, 53). A host page opens GridCraft with ?mode=view|comment|edit
and may change it later with gridcraft:mode { mode }. View mode puts back any change to the
workbook; comment mode keeps only the user's own notes and comments (and their replies to others'
threads). What a person only looks at is never put back. gridcraft:saveNow saves as File › Save
would, for a host that autosaves. Only apps/gridcraft-web changes; tests: src/access/tests.rs.
Pinned tag: see vendor/GRIDCRAFT_VERSION.

